<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday 欣怡</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9a9e,#fad0c4);
font-family:"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
overflow:hidden;
}

.card{
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
padding:40px;
border-radius:25px;
text-align:center;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
max-width:600px;
width:90%;
animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

h1{
color:#ff4d6d;
margin-bottom:20px;
font-size:2rem;
}

.message{
font-size:1.3rem;
line-height:2;
color:#444;
}

.signature{
margin-top:25px;
font-size:1.4rem;
color:#ff4d6d;
font-weight:bold;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{transform:translateY(0);}
50%{transform:translateY(-10px);}
100%{transform:translateY(0);}
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
font-size:24px;
animation:fall linear infinite;
}

@keyframes fall{
0%{
transform:translateY(-100px);
opacity:1;
}
100%{
transform:translateY(110vh);
opacity:0;
}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">
<h1>🎂 Happy Birthday 欣怡 🎂</h1>

<div class="message">
感谢你陪伴我的每一天<br><br>
愿你未来的每一天都充满阳光
</div>

<div class="signature">
—— 爱你的小唐 ❤️
</div>

</div>

<script>

for(let i=0;i<40;i++){

const heart=document.createElement("div");

heart.innerHTML="❤️";

heart.className="heart";

heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

heart.style.animationDuration=
(5+Math.random()*8)+"s";

heart.style.top="-100px";

document.body.appendChild(heart);

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
